.TH AIO-SUITE 7 "August 2026" "aio 0.1.0" "Miscellaneous"
.SH NAME
aio-suite \- the All-In-One Pygame Launcher suite
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aio
is a single-file application that discovers every public pygame game and
launches or installs any of them by name or listing number. The suite
comprises five interfaces built on one catalogue:
.PP
.RS
.nf
+-------------------- aio --------------------+
|                                             |
|  catalogue                                  |
|   built-in (39)  PyPI (347)                 |
|   GitHub (163)   awesome (12)   = 561 total |
|         |                                   |
|   +-----+------+------+------+------+       |
|   | CLI | TUI  | GUI  | WUI  | Tray |       |
|   +-----+------+------+------+------+       |
|         |                                   |
|  launch / install                           |
|   python -m  |  pip install  |  git clone   |
+---------------------------------------------+
.fi
.RE
.SH GAME SOURCES
.TP
.B Built-in
pygame example games (1-39).
.TP
.B PyPI
pygame packages scanned from the pypi.org simple index (40-386).
.TP
.B GitHub
pygame repositories, top by stars (387-549).
.TP
.B Awesome
the curated awesome-pygame list (550-561).
.PP
Listings are cached in
.B pygame_games_cache.json
(PyPI 7 days, GitHub 24 hours, awesome 7 days).
.SH INTERFACES
.TP
.B CLI
Default interface; numbered catalogue plus
.IR list ,
.IR launch ,
.IR install ,
.IR doctor ,
.IR build ,
.IR jinja
and
.IR docs
actions. See
.BR aio-cli (1).
.TP
.B TUI
Curses menus for every source and an install prompt. See
.BR aio-tui (1).
.TP
.B GUI
tkinter notebook with one tab per source. See
.BR aio-gui (1).
.TP
.B WUI
Web UI plus a JSON API on localhost (default port 8080). See
.BR aio-wui (1).
.TP
.B Tray
pystray icon that spawns any interface. See
.BR aio-tray (1).
.SH BUILD
.RS
.nf
venv-build.sh  ->  cython --embed -3 aio.py  ->  gcc -O3  ->  aio_bin
.fi
.RE
The compiled binary resolves the venv Python at runtime and injects the venv
site-packages, so the toolchain works from one artifact. See
.BR aio (1).
.SH DOCUMENTATION
.TP
.B docs/INDEX.md
the documentation and build map (start here).
.TP
.B README.md
the top-level guide.
.TP
.B docs/html/
Doxygen API reference.
.PP
Regenerate with
.BR "aio docs all"
or
.BR "build-docs.sh" .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aio (1),
.BR aio-cli (1),
.BR aio-tui (1),
.BR aio-gui (1),
.BR aio-wui (1),
.BR aio-tray (1)
